## 3. MODELO DE DATOS (Domain Layer)

### ContentItem

```kotlin
package com.deck.domain.model

data class ContentItem(
    val id: String,
    val uri: Uri,
    val displayName: String,
    val mimeType: String,
    val size: Long,
    val dateTaken: Long,
    val bucketId: String? = null,
    val albumName: String? = null,
    val mediaType: MediaType,
    val duration: Long? = null,
    val metadata: Map<String, String>? = null,
    val thumbnail: Bitmap? = null,
    val sourceType: MediaSourceType
)

enum class MediaType { IMAGE, VIDEO, AUDIO, DOCUMENT, ARCHIVE }
enum class MediaSourceType { LOCAL_IMAGE, LOCAL_VIDEO, GOOGLE_PHOTOS, LOCAL_AUDIO, LOCAL_DOCUMENT }
```

### DeckState

```kotlin
data class DeckState(
    val items: List<ContentItem> = emptyList(),
    val currentIndex: Int = 0,
    val reviewedCount: Int = 0,
    val totalCount: Int = 0,
    val isLoading: Boolean = false,
    val error: String? = null,
    val isUndoVisible: Boolean = false,
    val lastDeletedItem: ContentItem? = null,
    val undoRemainingSeconds: Int = 5
)
```

### MediaFilter

```kotlin
data class MediaFilter(
    val types: List<MediaType>? = null,
    val albumId: String? = null,
    val dateRange: Pair<Long, Long>? = null
)
```

### Album

```kotlin
data class Album(
    val id: String,
    val name: String,
    val coverItemId: String? = null,
    val itemCount: Int = 0,
    val sourceType: MediaSourceType = MediaSourceType.LOCAL_IMAGE
)
```

