## 6. SEGURIDAD Y PRIVACIDAD

### Almacenamiento de Tokens

```kotlin
class TokenStorage @Inject constructor(private val context: Context) {
    private val masterKey = MasterKey.Builder(context)
        .setKeyScheme(MasterKey.KeyScheme.AES256_GCM)
        .build()

    private val sharedPreferences = EncryptedSharedPreferences.create(
        context, "google_auth_prefs", masterKey,
        EncryptedSharedPreferences.PrefKeyEncryptionScheme.AES256_SIV,
        EncryptedSharedPreferences.PrefValueEncryptionScheme.AES256_GCM
    )

    fun saveToken(token: String) { sharedPreferences.edit().putString("google_token", token).apply() }
    fun getToken(): String? = sharedPreferences.getString("google_token", null)
    fun clearToken() { sharedPreferences.edit().remove("google_token").apply() }
}
```

### Política de Logging

```kotlin
class SecureLogger @Inject constructor() {
    fun logEvent(event: AnalyticsEvent) {
        if (BuildConfig.DEBUG) {
            Timber.d(event.toString())
        } else {
            val sanitized = event.toSanitized()
            FirebaseAnalytics.getInstance().logEvent(sanitized.name, sanitized.params)
        }
    }
}
```

### Permisos (Por API Level)

| API Level | Permisos Necesarios |
|-----------|---------------------|
| 24-28 | `READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE`, `WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE` |
| 29 | `READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE`, `WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE` |
| 30-32 | `READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE` |
| 33+ | `READ_MEDIA_IMAGES`, `READ_MEDIA_VIDEO` |

